comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-18T04:12:30.301Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: all-status searches for dogfood duration and package-first explicit duration plus fresh open/in-progress inventories found no focused owner. This is follow-up verification for the already closed implementation; hosted run 35305204083 failed the existing Gates smokes negative control."
  "2026-09-18T04:16:12.008Z","harness:codex","Evidence: first PR head fc3f330 failed only Gates (smokes) because the existing dogfood fixture used duration=30m. Changed it to 30min and added an assertion against the persisted start/end span. The wrong-span negative-control test failed before implementation; all 39 script tests and the complete temporary package-first journey passed afterward. Packed npm/npx/bunx and Claude plugin smokes, ESLint and typecheck passed. CodeFactor and DeepScan found zero new issues on the first head; hosted coverage passed. CodeRabbit and Sourcery reviews were unavailable because of quota, and Greptile had not responded. Read and reacted to every bot artifact; no inline findings existed to answer. The next pushed head will trigger fresh reviews and all hosted gates."
